{
  "total": 339,
  "totalPage": 7,
  "page": 7,
  "pageSize": 50,
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b07d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5340,
      "bookHadithIndex": 301,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade Ishtimal As-Samma' and wrapping oneself in a single garment (that did not cover the private parts)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5340-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5340-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5340-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b07e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5341,
      "bookHadithIndex": 302,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade Ishtimal As-Samma' and wrapping oneself in a single garment (that did not cover the private parts)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5341-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5341-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5341-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b07f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5342,
      "bookHadithIndex": 303,
      "text": "It was narrated from Jabir that:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade Ishtimal As-Samma' and wrapping oneself in a single garment (that did not cover the private parts)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5342-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5342-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5342-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b080",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5343,
      "bookHadithIndex": 304,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ja'far bin 'Amr bin Huraith that his father said:\"I saw the Prophet [SAW] wearing a black turban",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5343-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5343-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5343-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b081",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5344,
      "bookHadithIndex": 305,
      "text": "It was narrated from Jabir that:On the Day of the Conquest of Makkah, the Messenger of Allah [SAW] entered (the city) wearing a black turban, and he was not in Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5344-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5344-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5344-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b082",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5345,
      "bookHadithIndex": 306,
      "text": "It was narrated that Jabir said:\"The Prophet [SAW] entered (Makkah) on the Day of the Conquest wearing a black turban",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5345-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5345-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5345-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b083",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5346,
      "bookHadithIndex": 307,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ja'far bin 'Amr bin Umayyah that his father said:\"It is as if I am looking now at the Messenger of Allah [SAW] on the Minbar, wearing a black turban, the end of which he has let hang down between his shoulders",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5346-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5346-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5346-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b084",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5347,
      "bookHadithIndex": 308,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Talhah that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"The angels do not enter a house in which there is a dog or an image",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5347-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5347-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5347-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b085",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5348,
      "bookHadithIndex": 309,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Talhah said:\"I heard the Messenger of Allah [SAW] say: 'The angels do not enter a house in which there is a dog or an image of an animate being",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5348-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5348-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5348-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b086",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5349,
      "bookHadithIndex": 310,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Ubaidullah bin 'Abdullah that:He entered upon Abu Talhah Al-Ansari to visit him (when he was sick), and he found Sahl bin Hunaif there. Abu Talhah told someone to remove a blanket from beneath him, and Sahl said to him: \"Why do you want to remove it?\" He said: \"Because there are images on it, and the Messenger of Allah [SAW] said what you know concerning them.\" He said: \"Did he not say: Except for patterns on fabrics?\" He said: \"Yes, but this makes me feel more comfortable",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5349-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5349-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5349-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b087",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5350,
      "bookHadithIndex": 311,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Talhah that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: \"The angels do not enter any house in which there is an image.\" Busr said: \"Then Zaid fell sick and we went to visit him, and on his door there was a curtain on which there was an image. I said to 'Ubaidullah Al-Khawlani: 'Didn't Zaid tell us about images yesterday?' 'Ubaidullah said: 'Didn't you hear him say: Except for patterns on fabrics?",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5350-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5350-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5350-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b088",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5351,
      "bookHadithIndex": 312,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Ali said:\"I made some food and invited the Prophet [SAW] (to come and eat). He came and entered, then he saw a curtain on which there were images, so he went out and said: 'The Angels do not enter a house in which there are images",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5351-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5351-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5351-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b089",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5352,
      "bookHadithIndex": 313,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] went out, then he came in, and I had hung up a curtain on which there were (images of) horses with wings. When he saw it, he said: 'Get rid of it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5352-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5352-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5352-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b08a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5353,
      "bookHadithIndex": 314,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah, the wife of the Prophet [SAW], said:\"We had a curtain on which there were images of birds, at the entrance to the house. The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'O 'Aishah, remove it, for ever time I come in and see it, I remember this world.'\" She said: \"We had a plush wrap, with a border on it, that we would wear, and it was not cut off",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5353-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5353-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5353-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b08b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5354,
      "bookHadithIndex": 315,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"In my house there was a cloth on which were images, which I put in a niche of the house, and the Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to pray facing it. Then he said: 'O 'Aishah, take it away from me.' So I took it down and made it into pillows",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5354-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5354-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5354-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b08c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5355,
      "bookHadithIndex": 316,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Aishah that:She put up a curtain on which there were images, then the Messenger of Allah [SAW] came in and took it down, so she cut it up (and made) two pillows. A man in the gathering there whose name was Rabi'ah bin 'Ata' said: \"I heard Abu Muhammad - meaning Al-Qasim - narrate that 'Aishah said: 'The Messenger of Allah [SAW] used to recline on them",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5355-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5355-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5355-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b08d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5356,
      "bookHadithIndex": 317,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] came from a journey, and I had hung a curtain on which there were images over a niche. He took it down and said: 'The people who will be most severely punished on the Day of Resurrection will be those who try to match the creation of Allah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5356-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5356-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5356-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b08e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5357,
      "bookHadithIndex": 318,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah, the wife of the Prophet [SAW], said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] entered upon me, and I had put up a curtain on which there were images. When he saw it, his face changed color, then he tore it down with his hand and said: 'The people who will be most severely punished on the Day of Resurrection will be those who try to imitate the creation of Allah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5357-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5357-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5357-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b08f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5358,
      "bookHadithIndex": 319,
      "text": "It was narrated that An-Nadr bin Anas said:\"I was sitting with Ibn 'Abbas when a man from among the people of Al-'Iraq came to him and said: 'I make these images; what do you say concerning them?' He said: 'Come closer, come closer. I heard Muhammad [SAW] say: Whoever makes an image in this world will be commanded on the Day of Resurrection to breathe a soul into it, and he will not be able to do so",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5358-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5358-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5358-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b090",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5359,
      "bookHadithIndex": 320,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Abbas said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Whoever makes an image will be punished until (he is commanded) to breathe a soul into it, and he will not be able to do so",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5359-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5359-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5359-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b091",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5360,
      "bookHadithIndex": 321,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Whoever makes an image will be commanded on the Day of Resurrection to breathe the soul into it but he will not be able to do so",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5360-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5360-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5360-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b092",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5361,
      "bookHadithIndex": 322,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn 'Umar that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"The makers of these images will be punished on the Day of Resurrection, and it will be said to them: 'Breathe life into that which you have created",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5361-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5361-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5361-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b093",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5362,
      "bookHadithIndex": 323,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Aishah, the wife of the Prophet [SAW], that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: \"The makers of these images will be punished on the Day of Resurrection, and it will be said to them: 'Bring to life that which you have created",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5362-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5362-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5362-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b094",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5363,
      "bookHadithIndex": 324,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah, the wife of the Prophet [SAW], said:\"The people who will be most severely punished on the Day of Resurrection will be those who try to match the creation of Allah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5363-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5363-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5363-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b095",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5364,
      "bookHadithIndex": 325,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Abdullah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Among the people who will be most severely punished on the Day of Resurrection will be the image-makers",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5364-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5364-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5364-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b096",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5365,
      "bookHadithIndex": 326,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"Jibril, peace be upon him, asked permission to enter upon the Prophet [SAW] and he said: 'Come in.' He said: 'How can I come in when there is a curtain in your house on which there are images? You should either cut off their heads or make it into a rug to be stepped on, for we Angels do not enter a house in which there are images",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5365-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5365-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5365-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b097",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5366,
      "bookHadithIndex": 327,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] would not pray in our blankets",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5366-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5366-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5366-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b098",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5367,
      "bookHadithIndex": 328,
      "text": "Anas narrated that :The sandals of the Messenger of Allah [SAW] had two straps",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5367-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5367-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5367-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b099",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5368,
      "bookHadithIndex": 329,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Amr bin Aws said:\"The sandals of the Messenger of Allah [SAW] had two straps",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5368-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5368-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5368-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b09a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5369,
      "bookHadithIndex": 330,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"If the strap of the sandal of one of you breaks, let him not walk in one sandal until he fixes it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5369-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5369-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5369-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b09b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5370,
      "bookHadithIndex": 331,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Razin said:\"I saw Abu Hurairah clap his hand to his forehead and say: 'O people of Al-'Iraq, you claim that I tell lies about the Messenger of Allah [SAW]. I bear witness that I heard the Messenger of Allah [SAW] say: If the strap of the sandal of one of you breaks, let him not walk in the other until he fixes it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5370-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5370-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5370-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b09c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5371,
      "bookHadithIndex": 332,
      "text": "It was narrated from Anas bin Malik that:The Prophet [SAW] lay down on a leather mat and sweated. Umm Sulaim got up and collected his sweat and put it in a bottle. The Prophet [SAW] saw her and said: \"What are you doing O Umm Sulaim?\" She said: \"I am putting your sweat in my perfume.\" And the Prophet [SAW] smiled",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5371-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5371-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5371-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b09d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5372,
      "bookHadithIndex": 333,
      "text": "It was narrated that Samurah bin Sahm said:\"I came to Abu Hashim bin 'Utbah when he was suffering the plague, and Mu'awiyah came to visit him. Abu Hashim wept. Mu'awiyah said to him: 'Why are you weeping? Is it because of some pain that is hurting you, or is it for this world, the best of which has gone?' He said: 'Neither, but the Messenger of Allah [SAW] gave me some advice, which I wish that I had followed. He said: \"Perhaps you will live to see wealth that will be distributed among the people when all that would suffice you of that would be a servant and a mount to ride in the cause of Allah.\" I lived to see that, and I accumulated (wealth)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5372-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5372-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5372-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b09e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5373,
      "bookHadithIndex": 334,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Umamah bin Sahl said:\"The pommel of the sword of the Messenger of Allah [SAW] was of silver",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5373-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5373-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5373-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b09f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5374,
      "bookHadithIndex": 335,
      "text": "It was narrated that Anas said:\"The metallic end of the scabbard of the Messenger of Allah [SAW] was of silver, the pommel of his sword was silver, and in between were rings of silver",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5374-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5374-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5374-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b0a0",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5375,
      "bookHadithIndex": 336,
      "text": "It was narrated that Sa'eed bin Abi Al-Hasan said:\"The pommel of the sword of the Messenger of Allah [SAW] was of silver",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5375-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5375-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5375-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b0a1",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5376,
      "bookHadithIndex": 337,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Ali said:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said to me: \"Say: O Allah, make me steadfast and guide me.\" And he forbade me to sit on Al-Mayathir.\" Al-Mayathir: Qassi which the women used to put on the saddles for their husbands, such as red cushions",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5376-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5376-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5376-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b0a2",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5377,
      "bookHadithIndex": 338,
      "text": "It was narrated that Humaid bin Hilal said:\"Abu Rifa'ah said: 'I came to the Messenger of Allah [SAW] while he was delivering a Khutbah, and said: \"O Messenger of Allah, a stranger has come to ask about his religion, for he does not know what his religion is.\" The Messenger of Allah [SAW] stopped delivering his Khutbah and turned to me. A chair was brought, and I think its legs were of iron. The Messenger of Allah [SAW] sat down on it and started to teach me what Allah has taught him, then he went and completed his Khutbah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5377-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5377-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5377-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b0a3",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5378,
      "bookHadithIndex": 339,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Juhaifah said:\"We were with the Prophet (ﷺ) in Al-Batha' and he was in a red tent, and some people were with him, and he was about to set out. Bilal came and called the Adhan, turning this way and that",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5378-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5378-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5378-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}